# Temperance marker — fix docker-harness tests broken by cli#245 file-fallback

- date: 2026-09-26
- branch: fix/harness-file-fallback-test-isolation

## Scope decision

Patch 2 tests in `.claude/hooks/tests/docker-harness-entry.test.sh` to set `CLAUDE_OAUTH_TOKEN_FILE=/dev/null` inside their bash -c blocks. Isolates from the file-fallback path added in PR #249.

## Answers

0. Right thing — yes; tests fail on operator Mac because the token file exists per PR #249 setup.
1. Simplest — yes; 2-line change in test file only.
2. Brute force — no; the fix follows the existing test pattern of overriding env.
3. Blast radius — 🟢 low; test-only change; no adopter effect.
4. Verification — re-run the test suite; expect 35/35 GREEN.
5. Reversible — yes.

